},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Sushi Bars","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Restaurants","historical_business_count":8}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"H9u7hpVQRp5-yD-kMofn-g","review_id":"uRNQ_NXx4VUh0dbuC6_X0Q","date":"2013-12-31T00:01:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.945999026298523,"text_excerpt":"If you're in the FQ and craving some affordable sushi this place can do the trick! Best sushi I've ever had? No, but it is tasty, quick and affordable. I have been here twice and loved being able to sit @ the bar and get great, personal service. I really, really enjoy their miso soup. I haven't tried any of their more fancy rolls, but plan to on my next stop in."},{"business_id":"H9u7hpVQRp5-yD-kMofn-g","review_id":"JS8QfbURGGjtlVOAxK9O3w","date":"2012-02-13T17:47:02","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9296866655349731,"text_excerpt":"I was wondering the streets of the French Quarter looking for a place to eat something somewhat healthy. I had already been in NOLA for 5 days eating all the bad things that everyone recommended, it was time for something different. SUSHI! Yes! I walked into Ginger Lime and I was a bit concerned that I was the one and only patron in the restaurant, but I sat at the bar and figured I'd give it a try. I was quickly greeted and given a menu and a glass of water. I ordered some hot tea and the Chirashi bowl. The server came out with a lovely box of bagged teas for me to choose from and a glass of hot water. The sushi in my bowl was fresh, had a clean taste and a nice presentation. My Chirashi..."},{"business_id":"H9u7hpVQRp5-yD-kMofn-g","review_id":"z0QJQ3F_yhGm95oJhzNBnA","date":"2012-01-11T04:25:19","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9273803234100342,"text_excerpt":"Well I don't know about the other reviews, but i actually ate there just recently and i can say I like it, it's pretty decent in my opinion. Very good atmosphere and a very good location. right next to the house of blues! the sushi i recommend is the sweet shrimp. Bon appetite! By the way, they deliver too!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
